    "detailed_description": "<strong>Chinese cuisine is famous all over the world, and its food culture has a long history, which includes the Chinese people's love for cuisine. <br>Over thousands of years, eight major cuisines of Shandong, Sichuan, Guangdong, Fujian, Jiangsu, Zhejiang, Hunan and Anhui have gradually evolved.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660310/extras/92f9854789d5131fbf9d1c7d546c465b.poster.avif?t=1648952239\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660310/extras/92f9854789d5131fbf9d1c7d546c465b.webm?t=1648952239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660310/extras/92f9854789d5131fbf9d1c7d546c465b.mp4?t=1648952239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>&quot;Master Boy&quot; is a happy-paced third-person cartoon casual role-playing game with Chinese cuisine as the theme. <br>Players can communicate with friends and accept tasks in charming urban areas: </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660310/extras/df1a539d9418ec582d08a06ce29a967a.poster.avif?t=1648952239\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660310/extras/df1a539d9418ec582d08a06ce29a967a.webm?t=1648952239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660310/extras/df1a539d9418ec582d08a06ce29a967a.mp4?t=1648952239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Exterminate invaders, defend farms and beaches, collect ingredients:</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c